          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the worktree and its git registration:\n%@\n\nA worktree with uncommitted changes is kept — you will be asked again before anything is discarded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "워크트리와 Git 등록을 삭제합니다:\n%@\n\n커밋하지 않은 변경이 있으면 보관하고, 버리기 전에 다시 확인합니다."
          }
